ed multi-word keyword search returning no results when any word appears in 500+ verses (e.g. \"holy, men, moved\" now correctly finds 2 Peter 1:21)"],["SPAN",{"class":"flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md font-sans text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-500/20 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-300/60 dark:border-emerald-500/30"},"Fix"]],["LI",{"class":"flex items-start gap-2.5 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/90"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-[0.55em]"}],["SPAN",{"class":"flex-1"},"Multi-word AND search now searches the rarest word first, then filters results client-side for remaining words — eliminates the API result limit that was cutting off valid matches"],["SPAN",{"class":"flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md font-sans text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-500/20 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-300/60 dark:border-purple-500/30"},"UI"]]]],["DIV",{"class":"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white/80 dark:bg-card/80 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm p-6 border-l-4 border-l-amber-500"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-1 sm:gap-3 mb-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full border font-sans text-xs font-semibold bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white border-amber-600/40"},"v0.4.202"],["SPAN",{"class":"font-sans text-sm text-muted-foreground"},"August 23, 2026"]],["UL",{"class":"space-y-2.5"},["LI",{"class":"flex items-start gap-2.5 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/90"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-[0.55em]"}],["SPAN",{"class":"flex-1"},"Updated search result copy format to use curly quotation marks around verse text with the reference after a dash: “verse text” - Reference (KJB)"],["SPAN",{"class":"fl